; The signatures tyr checks packages against, gathered in the build tree:
;
; - NativeSem's R C API signatures (*.ty). NativeSem looks for a `types/`
;   directory among the ancestors of the working directory, and reads only its
;   .ty files: here they are reachable from the build tree (and from
;   `dune exec tyr`).
; - Rsem's base R signatures (*.R), the prelude: pass them with --prelude
;   (e.g. --prelude _build/default/types/base.R). They are installed too, so
;   that the image, and anyone with `tyr` in their switch, can point --prelude
;   at them.
(copy_files
 (files %{project_root}/external/nativesem/types/*.ty))

(copy_files
 (files %{project_root}/external/Rsem/sigs/*.R))

(install
 (section share)
 (package tyr)
 (files base.R stats.R utils.R methods.R))
